### 0.3.8 版本 (2026-05-29)

抽屉与分割线组件增强。

- **更新组件 (2 个)**: [divider](./divider.zh.mdc), [drawer](./drawer.zh.mdc)
- **关键特性**:
  - TxDrawer 支持四方向滑出与全屏模态；
  - TxDivider 增加渐变透明分割模式。

### 0.3.7 版本 (2026-05-28)

基础录入与排版组件补齐。

- **新增组件 (4 个)**: [divider](./divider.zh.mdc), [kbd](./kbd.zh.mdc), [number-input](./number-input.zh.mdc), [textarea](./textarea.zh.mdc)
- **更新组件 (16 个)**: [avatar](./avatar.zh.mdc), [chat](./chat.zh.mdc), `flat-input`, [flat-radio](./flat-radio.zh.mdc), [flat-select](./flat-select.zh.mdc), [flip-overlay](./flip-overlay.zh.mdc), [glass-surface](./glass-surface.zh.mdc), [group-block](./group-block.zh.mdc), [icon](./icon.zh.mdc), [input](./input.zh.mdc), [scroll](./scroll.zh.mdc), [slider](./slider.zh.mdc), [stagger](./stagger.zh.mdc), [stat-card](./stat-card.zh.mdc), [tabs](./tabs.zh.mdc), [transfer](./transfer.zh.mdc)
- **关键特性**:
